{"resourceIdentifier":"3981","resourceName":"Qinghai Muge Swine Farm Manure Management System GHG Mitigation Project","description":"It is estimated that the total manure treatment capacity of the project is 6,000 m3 for the 4 digesters. The biogas produced by the swine farms using the digesters can be used for heating, for supplying organic fertilizer processing production, etc. It will not be provided to other users. Baseline emissions from heat generation have been ignored for the sake of prudence.\r\nThe project activity will reduce greenhouse gases in the atmosphere by avoiding methane emissions from the anaerobic treatment of pig manure and wastewater. It is estimated that  156,672 tCO2e of emission reductions will be generated annually, for a total of  1,096,702 tCO2e over the crediting period.","location":{"latitude":36.290827,"longitude":95.245277},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-01-09","endExclusive":"2023-02-09","endInclusive":"2023-02-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3981"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Qinghai Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Golmud Xingjiang MUGE FOOD Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Qinghai Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"30789"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Livestock, enteric fermentation, and manure management"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0010"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"01/08/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":